                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Nearby Cafe – A Cool Coffee Haven After Brunch\n\nWe stopped by Nearby Cafe for a post-brunch coffee and were pleasantly surprised. The café offers a quiet and cozy environment, perfect for relaxing or chatting after a meal.\n\nWe ordered the ice cube coffee latte and iced drip coffee with a hint of honey—both were refreshing and full of flavor, ideal for a hot day. The quality of the coffee really stood out, and you can tell they care about the brewing process.\n\nIf you\u0027re in the area and need a cool break with great coffee, Nearby Cafe is definitely worth a visit!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
